const TF3BUTTERFLY=`<div class="passage tfpage"><h4>Chapter 5: Butterflies</h4><h5>Life Cycle</h5><p>A butterfly starts as an egg. Next it becomes a caterpillar, then a <b>chrysalis</b>, and at last a butterfly.</p><h5>What Butterflies Eat</h5><p>Butterflies drink nectar from flowers with a long tube called a <b>proboscis</b>.</p><p class="note"><b>Caption:</b> A monarch butterfly drinks nectar from a purple flower.</p><p class="note"><b>Glossary:</b> <b>chrysalis</b>: the hard case a caterpillar makes before it becomes a butterfly. <b>proboscis</b>: a long tube for drinking.</p></div>`;
const TF3PARK=`<div class="passage tfpage"><h4>Map of Pine Park</h4><p class="note"><b>Map key:</b> 🌳 = trees &nbsp;·&nbsp; 🛝 = playground &nbsp;·&nbsp; 🚻 = restrooms &nbsp;·&nbsp; 💧 = water fountain</p><p>The playground is in the north part of the park. The pond is in the south. The picnic tables are next to the pond. The restrooms are on the east side, near the parking lot.</p><p class="note"><b>Compass rose:</b> N is at the top of the map.</p></div>`;
